=== a_backlink_is_the_rows_that_reference-1 eval
--- source
u.<identities.user
--- params
u|User|User { id: users.key(1), name: "ann" }
--- shape
set
--- type
Identity
--- expected
EmailPass { id: identities.key(uuid("00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001")), user: users.key(1), email: "ann@example.com", hash: 0x6831 }
Google { id: identities.key(uuid("00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002")), user: users.key(1), gid: "g-ann" }
=== a_backlink_is_the_rows_that_reference-2 eval
--- source
from i in identities where i.user == key u select i
--- params
u|User|User { id: users.key(1), name: "ann" }
--- shape
set
--- type
Identity
--- expected
EmailPass { id: identities.key(uuid("00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001")), user: users.key(1), email: "ann@example.com", hash: 0x6831 }
Google { id: identities.key(uuid("00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002")), user: users.key(1), gid: "g-ann" }
